on other terms, but may not purport to remove these conditions from the
Covered Software or grant recipients rights You do not possess.

4. Paid commercial license above the threshold

If Your Group's ARR exceeds USD 1,000,000, You must obtain a separate written,
paid commercial license from Licensor before using, copying, modifying or
distributing the Covered Software in reliance on this license. Contact
sales@ahvm.app. Merely sending an enquiry, negotiating, purchasing hosting or
support, or receiving no reply does not grant a commercial software license.
Fees and scope are agreed in that separate written agreement.

Reassess eligibility at each calendar month-end. If You cease to be Eligible,
permissions under this license end unless a separate commercial license
covers Your continued activity. Retaining a non-operational archival copy
for legal recordkeeping is permitted. Section 1's preservation of existing
and third-party rights applies regardless of Your ARR.

